GRAVESTONES.

CAUGHT BEHIND ENEMY LINES, GRU INTELLIGENCE HAS SENT NEW 
ORDERS. DIRECTLY ALONG 1ST TROOP'S RETURN PATH IS AN ENEMY 
COMMUNICATIONS EMPLACEMENT. 1ST TROOP IS ORDERED TO DESTROY 
ALL COMMUNICATIONS ELEMENTS WITHIN THE DESIGNATED KILL ZONE.

1ST TROOP IS FURTHER AUTHORIZED TO ASSUME A COURSE HEADING ALONG
A SOUTH/WEST VECTOR. YOUR OBJECTIVE WILL BE THE SIGNALS/
INTELLIGENCE RELAY ENCAMPMENT NATO ADVISORY FORCES HAVE 
ESTABLISHED IN THE REGION.

1ST TROOP IS ORDERED TO SANCTION ALL ELEMENTS WITHIN THIS 
ENCAMPMENT.
